name: Vurminal
icon: https://mahi902.github.io/DocuWritePro/sca/vurminal/icon.svg
version: 1.5.0
creator: Mohtadi Azad Mahi
description: Connects Sugarcane to a Vurminal terminal receiver over PeerJS. The receiver sends slash commands, the add-on executes them in the editor and returns results — you are the AI. The full Pollinations command set is included: find/replace, formatting, tables, page operations, export/print, stats, /click (limitless), and more. Scope/element permissions and Explore Mode live in the receiver's title-bar menu.
p/html:
p/css: https://mahi902.github.io/DocuWritePro/sca/vurminal/vurminal.css
p/js: https://mahi902.github.io/DocuWritePro/sca/vurminal/vurminal.js
